The constraints force a unique schedule. Ben, Finn and Ivo must occupy three consecutive slots, and "exactly one person between Dev and Finn" puts Dev two slots before Finn. Dev's and Finn's other constraints then force Ben into slot 2, which leaves only slots 5–9 for Ann, Cara, Elif, Gus and Hana. Checking the remaining gap constraints there leaves exactly one arrangement.

SCHEDULE: {"1":"Dev","2":"Ben","3":"Finn","4":"Ivo","5":"Elif","6":"Ann","7":"Cara","8":"Hana","9":"Gus"}
CONFIDENCE: 97
